          <div class="course-footer"><strong>6 lessons</strong><a href="#join">Learn more ↗</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="course-card">
        <div class="course-art">🎨</div>
        <div class="course-body">
          <span class="tag">CREATIVE</span>
          <h3>UI Design Basics</h3>
          <p>Practise colors, spacing, typography and clean page layouts.</p>
          <div class="course-footer"><strong>8 lessons</strong><a href="#join">Learn more ↗</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="course-card">
        <div class="course-art">🚀</div>
