    </div>
    <div class="announcement">
      <strong>📢 New practice challenge:</strong> Build a responsive profile card using Grid or Flexbox.<br><br>
      <strong>Tip 1:</strong> Start with a simple layout, then add spacing and colors.<br>
      <strong>Tip 2:</strong> Use a media query to make the layout fit smaller screens.<br>
      <strong>Tip 3:</strong> Try hovering over the course cards to see the transition and transform effects.<br>
      <strong>Tip 4:</strong> Inspect the registration form to explore :focus, :required and :checked.<br>
