  <div class="hidden-demo">This element is hidden by display: none.</div>
</main>

<footer>
  <strong>Creative Learning Hub</strong>
  <p>A CSS learning project — explore the source code and find each property label.</p>
  <p>Built with HTML and CSS only.</p>
